WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit with shins folded like a narrow 90/90.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Lean slightly and switch the legs to the other side.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep the chest tall through the transition.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Pause in each shin box.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Move slowly for several switches.
